# Pieces: fragments a line takes now and then, chosen by who she is and where you are.
# {@open} goes before her line, {@tail} after it, {@meopen} before yours (Conversation.Compose). Each value of each
# factor has at least two lines; the most specific rule wins (one step of slack), so a girlfriend who is cool gets the
# cool girlfriend openers, and a tail is one of the factors that hold right now (mood, place, period, club, sign,
# birthday, body, role...). Openers always end in a stop, so her line keeps its capital letter.

# ================= openers: relation x tone =================
@rule open.gf.gentle
on @open
when rel=girlfriend tone=gentle
- [Mm, you know what?|Hey, love...|Ehehe...]
- [Ah, I'm happy you came.|Hi, you.|Mm, I missed you today.]

@rule open.gf.energetic
on @open
when rel=girlfriend tone=energetic
- [Babe!|There you are!|Finally, my favorite person!]
- [Hehe, hi hi!|You came to see me!|Okay, okay, listen!]

@rule open.gf.cool
on @open
when rel=girlfriend tone=cool
- [...Oh. It's you.|You're late. Kidding.|Hm. I was hoping you'd come.]
- [...Hey.|Don't make that face. I'm glad you're here.|Mm. Sit.]

@rule open.gf.teasing
on @open
when rel=girlfriend tone=teasing
- [Missed me already?|Look who can't stay away~|Hey, handsome~]
- [Oh? My boyfriend, all by himself?|There's my favorite distraction~|Couldn't wait until later, huh?]

@rule open.lover.gentle
on @open
when rel=lover tone=gentle
- [Oh... hi.|Ah, it's you...|Mm, hello.]
- [I was just thinking about you.|You always find me, don't you?]

@rule open.lover.energetic
on @open
when rel=lover tone=energetic
- [Hey hey!|Oh! It's you!|Perfect timing!]
- [I was hoping I'd run into you!|You again? Yay!]

@rule open.lover.cool
on @open
when rel=lover tone=cool
- [...You.|Hm. Hello.|Oh. Hey.]
- [I wasn't waiting for you. Just so you know.|...You came over.]

@rule open.lover.teasing
on @open
when rel=lover tone=teasing
- [You're following me now?|Oh my, look who it is~]
- [Can't keep away, can you?|Hello, trouble~]

@rule open.friend.gentle
on @open
when rel=friend tone=gentle
- [Oh, hi!|Ah, it's you.|Hello again.]
- [It's nice to see a friendly face.|Mm, hello.]

@rule open.friend.energetic
on @open
when rel=friend tone=energetic
- [Yo!|Hey, buddy!|What's up?!]
- [Ooh, perfect, I needed someone to talk to!|Hiya!]

@rule open.friend.cool
on @open
when rel=friend tone=cool
- [Hey.|Oh. You.|Hm.]
- [What's up.|You again. Fine.]

@rule open.friend.teasing
on @open
when rel=friend tone=teasing
- [Well, well.|Oh, it's you~|Bored without me?]
- [Came to see me again?|Look who's here~]

@rule open.crush.friend
on @open
when rel=friend interest=yes
- [O-oh! Hi!|Ah... hi. Um.|Hi! I mean, hey.]
- [You startled me.|Oh! I was just... hi.]

@rule open.acq.gentle
on @open
when rel=acquaintance tone=gentle
- [Oh, um, hello.|Ah, hi.|Oh, it's you.]
- [Hello there.|Um... hi.]

@rule open.acq.energetic
on @open
when rel=acquaintance tone=energetic
- [Oh, hey!|Hi hi!|Hey there!]
- [Oh, you!|Heya!]

@rule open.acq.cool
on @open
when rel=acquaintance tone=cool
- [...Yes?|Hm?|What is it?]
- [Oh. Hello.|Can I help you?]

@rule open.acq.teasing
on @open
when rel=acquaintance tone=teasing
- [Oh? Hello.|Well, hi there.|Hm, you again?]
- [Are you lost?|Need something, mister?]

@rule open.stranger
on @open
when rel=stranger
- [Um... hello?|Oh. Hi.]
- [Huh? Me?|Sorry, do I know you?]

# ================= openers: role =================
@rule open.teacher
on @open
when role=teacher
- [Ahem.|Oh, it's you.|Well, well, a student.]
- [Shouldn't you be studying?|Mm-hm.]

@rule open.exteacher
on @open
when role=exteacher
- [Ah, old habits... I almost said "class".|Hey. Not your teacher anymore, remember?]
- [Funny, sitting on this side of the desk now.|You can drop the "sensei" now.]

@rule open.story
on @open
when role=story
- [Oh! You came to find me again.|Ah, it's you.]
- [You always show up at the right moment.|Hi, again.]

@rule open.exstory
on @open
when role=exstory
- [Ah, it's you. Being a regular student is strange.|Oh, hi. Life's calmer these days.]
- [Hey. Without all that drama, I almost miss it.|Hi. It's nice to just be a normal girl here.]

# ================= tails: mood =================
@rule tail.mood.cheerful
on @tail
when mood=cheerful
- [I'm in a really good mood today, by the way.|Today's a good day, I can feel it.|Hehe, sorry, I can't stop smiling today.]
- [Everything's going right today.|I don't know why, but I feel great.]

@rule tail.mood.hungry
on @tail
when mood=hungry
- [Sorry, my stomach just growled.|Ugh, I'm starving, though.|Can we talk near food?]
- [I skipped breakfast. Big mistake.|All I can think about is lunch.]

@rule tail.mood.bored
on @tail
when mood=bored
- [At least this beats being bored.|Today's so slow, you're saving me.|Nothing's happening today.]
- [Please say something interesting happened somewhere.|I've been bored out of my mind.]

@rule tail.mood.stressed
on @tail
when mood=stressed
- [Sorry, I've got a lot on my mind.|My head's kind of full today.|Ugh, I have too much to do.]
- [I just need one quiet day.|I'm a little stressed, if you can't tell.]

@rule tail.mood.lonely
on @tail
when mood=lonely
- [I'm glad someone came to talk to me.|It's been a lonely day.|Thanks for stopping by, really.]
- [Everyone's busy lately.|I was hoping someone would show up.]

@rule tail.mood.flirty
on @tail
when mood=flirty
- [You look nice today, by the way.|Is it hot in here, or is it you?|I'm in a strange mood today~]
- [Don't look at me like that, I'll get ideas.|Stay close, okay?]

@rule tail.mood.sleepy
on @tail
when mood=sleepy
- [Sorry, I'm half asleep.|*yawn* ...Sorry.|I stayed up way too late.]
- [If I doze off, wake me up.|My eyes keep closing on their own.]

@rule tail.mood.upset
on @tail
when mood=upset
- [Sorry, I'm a bit off today.|Don't mind me, I'm just in a mood.]
- [Let's keep it light, okay?|I'm trying to get my mind off things.]

# ================= tails: place =================
@rule tail.place.library
on @tail
when placeid=library
- [We should keep it down, though.|The librarian's glaring at us.]
- [I love the smell of old books here.|It's so quiet in here I can hear myself think.]

@rule tail.place.gym
on @tail
when placeid=gym
- [It smells like sweat in here, ugh.|Someone's always bouncing a ball in here.]
- [The gym's echoey. Careful what you say.|Watch out for stray balls.]

@rule tail.place.pool
on @tail
when placeid=pool
- [The chlorine always gets in my hair.|The water looks nice today.]
- [Don't push me in, okay?|Hm, I kind of want to jump in.]

@rule tail.place.rooftop
on @tail
when placeid=rooftop
- [The view up here is the best.|The wind up here is crazy.]
- [I come up here to breathe.|You can see the whole town from here.]

@rule tail.place.infirmary
on @tail
when placeid=infirmary
- [Shh, someone might be sleeping.|It smells like disinfectant in here.]
- [The beds here are surprisingly comfy.|Don't tell the nurse I was lazing around.]

@rule tail.place.cafeteria
on @tail
when placeid=cafeteria
- [Everything here smells so good.|The line's insane today.]
- [I always end up buying too much here.|Have you tried the curry bread?]

@rule tail.place.clubroom
on @tail
when placeid=clubroom
- [Don't touch anything in here, it's all in a delicate order.|This room's a mess, sorry.]
- [The club room's kind of our base.|We should clean in here someday.]

@rule tail.place.staffroom
on @tail
when placeid=staffroom
- [We're in the staff room, so... behave.|The teachers are listening, you know.]
- [It's so stiff in here.|I always feel like I'm in trouble here.]

@rule tail.place.classroom
on @tail
when placeid=classroom
- [Class feels so far away now.|My desk's right there, by the window.]
- [Someone left their bag again.|The board's still full of formulas.]

@rule tail.place.courtyard
on @tail
when placeid=courtyard
- [The flowers here are pretty, aren't they?|I like the courtyard at this hour.]
- [The bench here is my favorite.|It's nice to be outside for a bit.]

@rule tail.place.field
on @tail
when placeid=field
- [The track team's running laps again.|There's dust everywhere out here.]
- [It's so open out here.|The sun's strong today.]

@rule tail.place.park
on @tail
when placeid=park
- [The park's nice at this time.|I saw a cat around here earlier.]
- [It's good to be off campus.|Look at the trees, they're so green.]

# ================= tails: period =================
@rule tail.period.lunch
on @tail
when period=lunch
- [Did you eat yet?|Lunch break always goes by too fast.]
- [Don't let me forget to eat.|I hope the bread isn't sold out.]

@rule tail.period.club
on @tail
when period=club hasclub=yes
- [I should be at the {club}, though.|They'll be waiting for me at the {club}.]
- [I'm sneaking a break from the {club}.|Don't tell the {club} I'm slacking.]

@rule tail.period.after
on @tail
when period=after
- [It's getting late, huh.|The sky's turning orange.]
- [I should head home soon.|After school is the best time of day.]

# ================= tails: club =================
@rule tail.club.sports
on @tail
when clubkind=sports
- [My legs are sore from practice.|Practice was brutal yesterday.]
- [We have a match coming up.|The {club} captain's a slave driver.]

@rule tail.club.culture
on @tail
when clubkind=culture
- [We're working on something at the {club}.|The {club} has a project going.]
- [The {club} is kind of my second home.|You should visit the {club} sometime.]

# ================= tails: sign =================
@rule tail.sign.aries
on @tail
when sign=aries
- [My horoscope said to be bold today, so...|Aries never back down, you know.]
- [I'm an Aries, I can't sit still.|My horoscope promised me an adventure today.]

@rule tail.sign.taurus
on @tail
when sign=taurus
- [Taurus people just like comfy things, okay?|My horoscope said to treat myself today.]
- [I'm a Taurus. I'm stubborn, I know.|Today's horoscope said good food is coming.]

@rule tail.sign.gemini
on @tail
when sign=gemini
- [I'm a Gemini, so I might change my mind later.|My horoscope said I'd meet someone chatty.]
- [Gemini, you know. Two of me.|My horoscope said today's for talking.]

@rule tail.sign.cancer
on @tail
when sign=cancer
- [My horoscope said to stay close to people I trust.|I'm a Cancer. I get attached, sorry.]
- [Cancers are homebodies, you know.|Today's horoscope said someone would cheer me up.]

@rule tail.sign.leo
on @tail
when sign=leo
- [My horoscope said I'd shine today.|Leos deserve attention, it's science.]
- [I'm a Leo. Of course I'm the star.|Today's horoscope said I'm unstoppable.]

@rule tail.sign.virgo
on @tail
when sign=virgo
- [My horoscope said to tidy my life up.|I'm a Virgo, I notice details.]
- [Virgos plan everything. I'm planning this.|Today's horoscope said to trust my list.]

@rule tail.sign.libra
on @tail
when sign=libra
- [My horoscope said to find balance today.|I'm a Libra, I hate choosing.]
- [Libras like pretty things. And people.|Today's horoscope said harmony's coming.]

@rule tail.sign.scorpio
on @tail
when sign=scorpio
- [My horoscope said secrets would come out today.|I'm a Scorpio. I see through people.]
- [Scorpios hold grudges. Just saying.|Today's horoscope said to trust my gut.]

@rule tail.sign.sagittarius
on @tail
when sign=sagittarius
- [My horoscope said to go somewhere new.|I'm a Sagittarius, I want to travel everywhere.]
- [Sagittarius can't stay in one place.|Today's horoscope said luck is on my side.]

@rule tail.sign.capricorn
on @tail
when sign=capricorn
- [My horoscope said hard work pays off today.|I'm a Capricorn, I take things seriously.]
- [Capricorns climb, slowly but surely.|Today's horoscope said to be patient.]

@rule tail.sign.aquarius
on @tail
when sign=aquarius
- [My horoscope said to try something weird today.|I'm an Aquarius, I'm a little odd.]
- [Aquarius people do their own thing.|Today's horoscope said a strange idea is coming.]

@rule tail.sign.pisces
on @tail
when sign=pisces
- [My horoscope said to follow my dreams today.|I'm a Pisces, I daydream a lot.]
- [Pisces feel everything too much.|Today's horoscope said to listen to my heart.]

# ================= tails: birthday =================
@rule tail.bday.today
on @tail
when birthday=today
- [Also, um... today's my birthday.|By the way, it's my birthday today. Just saying!]
- [Guess what day it is? My birthday!|I'm a year older today. Weird, right?]

@rule tail.bday.week
on @tail
when birthday=week
- [My birthday's this week, you know.|It's my birthday week, so be nice to me.]
- [My birthday's coming up any day now.|I've been dropping hints about my birthday all week.]

@rule tail.bday.soon
on @tail
when birthday=soon
- [My birthday's not far off, by the way.|I'm already thinking about my birthday next week.]
- [Next week's my birthday. Not that I care.|Mark your calendar, my birthday's soon.]

# ================= tails: body =================
@rule tail.height.tall
on @tail
when height=tall
- [Being this tall, I see everything from up here.|I always hit my head on the door frames here.]
- [Tall girls get stared at, you know.|At least I can reach the top shelf.]

@rule tail.height.short
on @tail
when height=short
- [Don't look down at me like that.|Being short is hard, I can't reach anything.]
- [I'm small, but I'm tough.|Everyone pats my head. It's annoying. Kind of.]

@rule tail.bust.big
on @tail
when bust=big lewd>=30
- [My shoulders are killing me today, by the way.|This uniform's too tight on me.]
- [Eyes up here, mister.|Ugh, the buttons on this blouse are struggling.]

@rule tail.bust.small
on @tail
when bust=small lewd>=30
- [At least running is easy for me.|What are you looking at? Hmph.]
- [Small is cute, okay? Okay.|Don't compare me to the others.]

# ================= tails: role and relation =================
@rule tail.role.teacher
on @tail
when role=teacher
- [Anyway, don't forget your homework.|And don't be late to class tomorrow.]
- [I have a stack of papers to grade, sadly.|Teachers have lives too, you know.]

@rule tail.role.exteacher
on @tail
when role=exteacher
- [I still catch myself grading things in my head.|Being on this side is freeing.]
- [No more red pens for me.|Don't tell anyone I miss teaching a little.]

@rule tail.role.exstory
on @tail
when role=exstory
- [A normal school life suits me now.|I'm still getting used to being a regular student.]
- [Things are quieter since everything settled.|I like being just another girl in class.]

@rule tail.rel.gf
on @tail
when rel=girlfriend
- [I'm glad you're mine, you know.|Walk me home later?]
- [I like these little moments with you.|You're the best part of my day.]

@rule tail.days.many
on @tail
when days=many rel=friend|lover|girlfriend
- [We talk every day now, huh.|You're starting to know me too well.]
- [It's become our thing, these chats.|I'd miss these talks if they stopped.]

@rule tail.partner
on @tail
when partner=*
- [{Partner} would like this too.|I should tell {partner} about this.]
- [{Partner}'s waiting for me later.|Don't tell {partner} I said that.]

@rule tail.bff
on @tail
when bff=*
- [{Bff} would laugh at this.|Remind me to tell {bff} later.]
- [{Bff} and I talked about this yesterday.|Don't tell {bff} I said that.]

@rule tail.fav
on @tail
when fav=* likes!=yes|no
- [Honestly, I'd rather {favdo} right now.|After this I want to {favdo}.]
- [Have I told you I love {fav}?|{Fav} would fix my whole day.]

# ================= your openers =================
@rule meopen.gf
on @meopen
when rel=girlfriend
- [Hey, babe.|So, love...|Hey, you.]
- [Mm, {name}...|Hey, beautiful.]

@rule meopen.lover
on @meopen
when rel=lover
- [Hey, {name}.|So...]
- [Hey, you.|{Name}...]

@rule meopen.friend
on @meopen
when rel=friend
- [Hey, {name}!|Yo.|So, {name}.]
- [Hey.|Okay, so...]

@rule meopen.acq
on @meopen
when rel=acquaintance
- [Um, hi.|Hey, {name}, right?]
- [Hi there.|Hey.]

@rule meopen.teacher
on @meopen
when role=teacher
- [Sensei.|Excuse me, sensei.]
- [Um, sensei?|Sensei, got a minute?]

@rule meopen.exteacher
on @meopen
when role=exteacher
- [Hey, {name}. Not sensei anymore, right?|So, {name}.]
- [Hey, ex-sensei.|{Name}.]
